WEBVTT

00:45:57.454 --> 00:46:00.746
among other things. Also just one about
sort of fairness in society

00:46:00.746 --> 00:46:03.621
and wealth concentration that didn't
feel right to us either.

00:46:04.454 --> 00:46:08.204
And so we came up with this kind
of hybrid where we have

00:46:08.204 --> 00:46:13.829
a nonprofit that governs what we do,
and it has a subsidiary, LLC,

00:46:14.454 --> 00:46:18.454
that we structure in a way to make
a fixed amount of profit

00:46:19.163 --> 00:46:20.913
so that all of our investors
and employees,

00:46:20.913 --> 00:46:23.663
hopefully if things go how we like,
if not no one gets any money,

00:46:24.579 --> 00:46:28.913
but hopefully they get to make this one
time great return on their investment

00:46:28.913 --> 00:46:31.288
or the time that they spent
it open their equity here.